Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you know there's more than one dark galaxy?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.20,0:00:11.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Last year, China's FAST telescope spotted FAST J01399P4328, another hydrogen cloud with
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.60,0:00:13.56,Default,,0,0,0,,almost no stars.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.56,0:00:17.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just over a million light years away, shaped like an S.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.48,0:00:24.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Its total mass is around 5 billion suns, but the stars make up less than 700,000 suns.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.64,0:00:28.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Ordinary matter is just 1 and 50th of its mass.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.52,0:00:31.04,Default,,0,0,0,,In other words, it's a dark matter monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.04,0:00:34.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Astronomers even have a name for these faint beasts.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.28,0:00:36.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Low surface brightness galaxies.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.04,0:00:41.96,Default,,0,0,0,,They're so dim, even their brightest parts are darker than our night sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.96,0:00:43.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Most are tiny dwarfs.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.96,0:00:49.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Once a cloud tops a billion solar masses, it usually fires up star formation, except
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.36,0:00:50.92,Default,,0,0,0,,these rebels.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.92,0:00:52.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Why care?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.32,0:00:56.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Because dark galaxies might solve the missing satellites problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.16,0:00:59.42,Default,,0,0,0,,We expect hundreds of small companions around the Milky Way.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.42,0:01:01.04,Default,,0,0,0,,We only see a dozen.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.04,0:01:04.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Could most be hidden, starless clouds?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.12,0:01:06.92,Default,,0,0,0,,These dark dwarfs are local fossils.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.92,0:01:09.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Galaxies frozen in time since the early universe.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.96,0:01:13.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Crazy to think we're living next to these ancient relics.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.02,0:01:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Share this if you want more space secrets.
